      "original_question": "高产演员分析（含多面手得分），找出参演高分电影最多的演员，同时计算角色多样性",
      "sql": "SELECT n.primary_name, COUNT(DISTINCT p.title_id) AS movie_count, ... FROM names n JOIN principals p ON p.name_id = n.id JOIN titles t ON t.id = p.title_id WHERE p.category_id IN ('actor', 'actress') AND t.title_type = 'movie' ... GROUP BY n.id, n.primary_name ORDER BY movie_count DESC LIMIT 20",
